stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OFF: EN=LOW
    OFF --> FORWARD: EN=HIGH, RPWM=PWM, LPWM=LOW
    OFF --> REVERSE: EN=HIGH, RPWM=LOW, LPWM=PWM
    FORWARD --> OFF: EN=LOW
    REVERSE --> OFF: EN=LOW
    FORWARD --> BRAKE: RPWM=LOW, LPWM=LOW
    REVERSE --> BRAKE: RPWM=LOW, LPWM=LOW

    note right of FORWARD
        PWM duty cycle controls speed
        PWM frequency: 1-20 kHz
        Recommended: 10 kHz
    end note

    note right of REVERSE
        LPWM signal controls speed
        RPWM stays LOW
    end note